# The whole sizeStr is "   5.0 MiB" but only "   5.0" gets the color
# "5.0" is the number, " MiB" is the unit

# But in gdu's original TUI code, it uses tview's color markup
# The number-color (#e67100) is applied to the numeric part only
# The unit is not colored

